<div class="pz-policy-page page-width" style="max-width: 820px; margin: 3.5rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; font-family: 'Barlow', system-ui, sans-serif;">
  <div style="border-bottom: 2px solid #000; padding-bottom: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 800; color: #ef4444; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;">Delivery Information</span>
    <h1 style="font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0.25rem 0 0;">Shipping &amp; Delivery Policy</h1>
  </div>

  <div style="line-height: 1.7; color: #334155; font-size: 0.95rem;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; color: #000; margin-top: 1.5rem;">1. Free Shipping Conditions</h3>
    <p>We provide <strong>100% Free Shipping</strong> on all prepaid orders (UPI, Google Pay, PhonePe, Debit/Credit Cards, Net Banking) across India. For Cash on Delivery (COD) orders, a standard handling fee applies to cover courier courier verification and collection charges.</p>

    <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; color: #000; margin-top: 1.5rem;">2. Processing &amp; Printing Time</h3>
    <p>Since all posters, collage kits, and split sets are freshly printed on heavy 300 GSM matte cardstock with high-definition pigment inks, orders are processed and packed within <strong>24 to 48 hours</strong>.</p>

    <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; color: #000; margin-top: 1.5rem;">3. Estimated Delivery Timeline</h3>
    <p>Once dispatched, shipments typically arrive within:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Metro Cities (Delhi, Mumbai, Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Chennai, Kolkata):</strong> 2 to 4 business days.</li>
      <li><strong>Rest of India:</strong> 4 to 6 business days.</li>
      <li><strong>Remote / Northeast regions:</strong> 5 to 7 business days.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; color: #000; margin-top: 1.5rem;">4. Packaging &amp; Damage Protection</h3>
    <p>All poster shipments are securely packed inside extra-thick rigid cylinders or reinforced corrugated mailers with waterproof wrapping to ensure your prints reach your room in pristine, uncreased condition.</p>
  </div>
</div>

